From 19ea52b4b39e50e21e06936d67925aeb0192c8e0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Daryl Denson <9751141+denson9874@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 00:50:33 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] SystemUI: drop the "Evolution X" default_user_name
 translations

Eight locales (hu, in, ku, pl, pt-BR, ru, tr, uk) carried
default_user_name as "Evolution X" (Ukrainian: "Evolution X logo"), a
mistranslation that showed Evolution X's name. The default-locale
evolution_strings.xml has no such string any more; like the Sleep mode
and Essential notifications strings next to it, these are leftovers, so
remove them.

Co-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
